WEBVTT

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.250
Pharian again?

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:41.200
Yes.

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:44.430
We only just came back from there...

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:47.770
The Thanatos can attack
anywhere and at any time.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:53.770
This time, however, I imagine it will be of special interest to Lein.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:01:00.570
Apparently, it has appeared inside an artifact that was recovered from the sea floor yesterday.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.050
An artifact recovered from the sea floor?

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:06.780
The Artifact Foundation...

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:42.060
Phase 03: The Silver Knight

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:10.450
This is Curil Village's famous pasta delicacy.

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:12.590
Chow down!

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:16.950
It's good!

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.420
Well, take your time.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:25.460
But is it really okay for us to take a detour just to eat a meal like this?

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.070
We're not going out of our way.

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.840
We've stopped here to stock up on supplies.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:32.750
We agreed to meet them tomorrow morning.

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:36.560
So it's bothering you after all, Lein?

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:43.010
It can't be helped; Nyx already told them we were coming.

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:47.480
I could have gone in Lein's place, you know...

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:53.840
You're hiding from the Foundation, aren't you?

00:03:57.260 --> 00:04:04.030
And for my part, the salty air in Pharia this time of year are a bit too much for my body.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:08.490
Well, I'm pretty interested in this artifact they excavated from the sea floor.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.400
You've heard of the Artifact Foundation, right?

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:20.370
They excavate ancient artifacts and then pretend to use that technology to lead the world to peace, but...

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:26.190
To be honest, I'm surprised they hired us.

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:27.960
Lein?

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:30.820
There's something they haven't told us about this job.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:36.620
But no matter what they're trying to do... a job's a job.

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:41.530
Going cheap! Going cheap!

00:04:57.850 --> 00:05:01.330
This is a wondrous place, isn't it, Lein?

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:03.270
Lein?

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:18.260
You really do love books, don't you, Lein?

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:29.020
Oh, we have to buy supplies, don't we?

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:33.910
Hey, Lein, why don't you let me go fetch what we need?

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:35.080
You sure?

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:36.720
But...

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.000
Don't worry.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:40.620
I think I can find everything we need on this street.

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:43.450
Take your time choosing a book.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.120
Let's meet at the carriage later.

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:53.440
This is the last of it!

00:05:57.680 --> 00:06:00.450
Lein should be back soon too...

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:09.860
What?

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:18.610
I could've sworn it flew this way...

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:25.130
What a gorgeous lake!

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:34.760
Who's there?

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:50.930
Um, well... that butterfly.

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:52.750
What butterfly?

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:56.520
Um...

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:03.350
Um... your shoulder...

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:10.600
Could you please step aside?

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.860
I'm sorry!

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:29.780
Um...

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:31.880
Huh?

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.830
Angelique!

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:43.680
Where were you?

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:45.490
A butterfly...

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:46.480
Butterfly?

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:49.250
No, it's nothing.

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:52.230
Don't go off wandering around by yourself.

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.550
The Thanatos often appear in forests.

00:07:54.610 --> 00:07:56.850
I'm sorry if I worried you.

00:07:56.960 --> 00:08:00.150
Let's load up our luggage and get going.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:13.810
Up until this point, the Foundation relied on the church to deal with matters involving the Thanatos.

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:16.170
Even though they were at odds with each other.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:20.520
The Silver Tree Knights of the Celestia Order...

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:21.730
Yeah.

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:26.490
They spend their time training to serve a Queen that will someday be born...

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:30.780
and they travel across Arcadia, purifying Thanatos as they go.

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:36.300
But this time, they came to us...

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:41.430
Which means the Foundation is also conscious of the Queen's Egg.

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:43.770
The Queen...

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:51.100
Angelique, you are Arcadia's only hope; you are the Queen's Egg.

00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:57.140
I still can't believe that I'm really the Queen's Egg, but...

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:14.460
Welcome, Professor Lein.

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:16.540
I never imagined you would come personally.

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:17.860
Professor?

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:20.530
I'd prefer you didn't call me that, Elen.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:27.190
And I'll thank you for not calling me that, either. I thank you for coming all this way.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:32.450
I'm Elenfriet. I'm in charge of this project.

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:34.290
My name is Angel-

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.950
We came here to defeat the Thanatos.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:38.390
Take us to it now.

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:41.470
You seem in a bad mood.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:46.390
Is it because this is a task that was commissioned by the Artifact Foundation?

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:49.140
I just want to finish up here and go home.

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:50.460
I see.

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:52.680
Then, please finish here quickly.

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:59.860
Oh, and please ensure you only eliminate the Thanatos and nothing else.

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:04.850
I'd rather not see a repeat of what happened last time, Professor Lein.

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:15.690
It's so fast!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:19.510
This car could take us back to the Sunlit Mansion in no time!

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:23.290
Is this your first time in an automobile?

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.610
Yes, it is.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.530
Look, you can see it from here.

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:32.730
That's...

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:38.920
Yes, that is the Stellar Vessel, the craft we recovered from the ocean floor yesterday.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.000
You're in the way.

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:11.890
Those guys...

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:14.850
They're not with the Foundation.

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:17.290
This is an artifact?

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:21.060
The Stellar Vessel... so it really does exist, huh?

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:29.210
It's said that the Stellar Vessel was created to travel the heavens; or in other words, it's a spaceship.

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:33.870
A ship that sails the heavens... that's so poetic!

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:38.460
When we've purified those Thanatos, this ship will be able to sail the heavens once more, right?

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:43.010
To think that the Queen's Egg would say something so frivolous...

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:44.090
You're right.

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:45.570
Let's go, Angelique.

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:46.670
Okay!

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:18.300
What's wrong, Angelique?

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:19.920
Are you scared?

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:21.770
No...

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:42.330
Wow... it's filled with all kinds of strange objects.

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:46.540
If I had the time, I'd love to examine them.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:21.930
What's wrong?

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:27.850
Here?

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:29.120
I think so...

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:31.580
It's all right..

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:40.170
Thanatos...

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:42.900
We'll take them all out at once.

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:52.490
Now, purify them!

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:53.180
Okay!

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:28.890
Are you all right?

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:29.880
Yes.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:34.560
Watch out!

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:40.360
H-Hey, wait!

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:43.720
Those guys were from the Foundation?

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:46.370
Angelique, let's follow them!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.410
Damn, they made it outside...

00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:07.500
The Thanatos from before?

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:12.820
Are you all right?

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:16.020
I'll hold off the Thanatos.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:18.590
You heal them!

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:19.760
Right!

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:24.450
This is one hell of a scoop!

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:33.020
Oh no, you don't!

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:35.970
What are you wasting time for?

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:37.810
You're already pushing it!

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:00.570
That man...

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:05.840
Thanatos: beings that cast a dark shadow over this world.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.930
With my spear, I shall slay you.

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:27.340
Are you a Purifier too?

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:30.530
Angelique!

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:39.650
With the power of purification, fill this world with gentleness!

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.330
This light...

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:49.380
Look!

00:16:49.930 --> 00:16:50.950
What is this?

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:52.880
The Thanatos are disintegrating!

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:54.430
Wow...

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:58.900
She's the fabled Queen's Egg?

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:07.050
Purification complete, Angelique.

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:08.410
Yeah.

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:12.410
That light was truly...

00:17:20.110 --> 00:17:22.480
I'm glad everyone's safe.

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.420
We've finished cleaning up the ship.

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:30.260
Thank you.

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:34.030
Those guys in the ship... what were you thinking?

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:36.760
It has nothing to do with you.

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:38.630
Don't ask questions.

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:41.320
Never mind.

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:43.560
They slowed down the purification, that's all.

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:46.550
See you around, Elen.

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:52.980
Professor Lein, your older brother was very disappointed in you.

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:56.850
Though, I guess you can't really face him right now.

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:05.270
Goodbye then. Be careful.

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:11.310
Lein's brother...

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:17.980
That man...

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:22.430
You're the guy from earlier...

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:28.720
My Queen, please forgive my rudeness in the forest.

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:33.690
I knew it was you!

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:35.590
I am Hyuuga.

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:41.880
Ever since witnessing the Aurora, I have searched the breadth of Arcadia for the Queen's Egg.

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:46.870
I recognize you as the Queen's Egg.

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:53.030
Your stance and posture... you're a member of the Silver Tree Knights.

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:56.480
It is true that I was once affiliated with the Knights.

00:18:57.340 --> 00:19:00.560
But now I wander alone, destroying Thanatos wherever I meet them.

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:06.340
And now I have met the Queen's Egg.

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:10.990
I also wish to become one of your disciples.

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:14.330
Hey, I'm not her disciple!

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:15.530
Please...

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:18.270
I will definitely try to be of some use to you.

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:27.000
Um, Hyuuga...

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:33.160
Then... will you join us as a companion?

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:35.520
A companion?

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.970
Hey, Angelique...

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:45.300
If Hyuuga joins us, I think we can save even more people!

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.250
Lady Angelique...

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:57.860
From this moment on, I shall be your shield.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:08.480
Thanks.

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:11.480
Look into her. Thoroughly.

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:13.050
Roger that.

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:17.610
See ya, and thanks again.

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:23.340
Is it really all right to let somebody like him come and go as he pleases?

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:34.860
Interesting data.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:40.350
Yes. Please wait until tomorrow for the detailed analysis.

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.780
Did he leave?

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:46.700
Yes, he's no longer of any use to the Foundat-

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:48.070
Elenfriet.

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:51.350
That's my decision to make.

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:53.260
Yes sir.

00:20:53.820 --> 00:21:01.680
If you truly believe she's the Queen's Egg, then the Foundation must find a use for her.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:05.600
I've already taken the next steps.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:09.000
Welcome home, Angelique.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:12.050
Lein, thank you for working so late.

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:14.280
Oh, who's this?

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:16.190
A new friend?

00:21:16.270 --> 00:21:18.650
Yes, his name is Hyuuga!

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:20.760
He's a Purifier too.

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:23.210
He helped us destroy some Thanatos.

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:24.740
If it's possible...

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:27.640
You're welcome here, Hyuuga.

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.710
Welcome to the Sunlit Mansion.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:33.240
Then, we'll have a welcoming party for Hyuuga tomorrow.

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:38.190
I thank you deeply for your warm reception.

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:45.410
Now then, come in. The apple pie will be ready in five minutes and thirty-two seconds!

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:47.770
You're always so specific!

00:23:36.280 --> 00:23:39.050
Lady Angelique, I shall prepare dinner.

00:23:39.090 --> 00:23:41.390
Wait, I've been preparing something since yesterday.

00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:42.690
This time, I must insist.

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:45.260
Then, is it all right if I eat both?

00:23:45.460 --> 00:23:47.690
Next time: Black Attack.

00:23:47.910 --> 00:23:49.380
It was scrumptious!
